        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1513076037041_873882_42167"/>
        <body>A StateDefinitionComposition is a type of StateDefinitionRelationship. It relates StateDefinition entities to one another, when two or more StateDefinition entities act as parts to compose a whole StateDefinition. Whole StateDefinition entities can also become parts of another whole StateDefinition.</body>
