            <body> &lt;sch:rule context="//TimeIntervalRelationship[@uid]"&gt;&#13; &lt;sch:let name="entity_name" value="if(@xsi:type) then substring-after(@xsi:type,':') else name()"/&gt;&#13; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt;&#13; &lt;sch:let name="uidRelating" value="../@uid"/&gt;&#13; &lt;sch:let name="uidRelated" value="Related/@uidRef"/&gt;&#13; &lt;sch:assert test="not(../@uid = Related/@uidRef)"&gt;&#13; The related TimeInterval and the relating TimeInterval shall be different. &#13; {&#13; -entity_name:&lt;sch:value-of select="$entity_name"/&gt;&#13; -entity_uid:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt; &#13; -rule_name:TimeIntervalRelationship.WR1&#13; -relating:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uidRelating"/&gt;&#13; -related:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uidRelated"/&gt;&#13; }&#13; &lt;/sch:assert&gt;&#13; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>WR1</name>
