        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1687961584246_759928_163380"/>
        <body>A VersionBranchEffectivity is a type of Effectivity for which the domain of applicability is defined as a possibly open-ended interval of versions. A 'start' value shall always be specified with Root, an 'end' value may be specified.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>VersionBranchEffectivity</name>
