        <body>A model artefact that allows a generic data type to be used as a class object for a select. The PropertyDefinitionStringProxy allows to represent a property definition as a string. &lt;note&gt;As it is a modelling artefact, it may not be represented in the implementation form if the implementation languages have more efficient representation of the type in the select.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
