          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1513093145456_657887_52801"/>
          <body>the other object of StateDefinition that is part of the relationship. &lt;note&gt;The semantics of this attribute are defined by the attribute RelationType.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
