        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1513076037047_192924_42177"/>
        <body>A StatePredicted is a type of State that represents a State in which something will be in the future. The StatePredictedToObserved entity shall be used when a StatePredicted needs to be related to a StateObserved. &lt;example&gt;It is anticipated that the aircraft will land in an un-serviceable state. Hence a set of maintenance activities are started.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>StatePredicted</name>
