        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193279_471505_23895"/>
        <body>An UncertaintyQualifier is a qualifier that specifies an uncertainty as defined in clause 2 of "The Guide to the Expression of Uncertainty in Measurement".</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>UncertaintyQualifier</name>
