    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193118_306906_23606" xmi:uuid="7b7a4e3c-a511-426e-8177-f01289f5f286" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455732586078_242756_43296" xmi:uuid="3f52e8f1-086f-4148-99a4-7df177c562dd" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193118_306906_23606"/>
        <body>An Identifier is a mechanism to provide the identifying name or code for the activity or product data.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1550054825673_380709_119483" xmi:uuid="edd0af6e-40a2-4246-9e71-dcafe765b3cc" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement href="../../../../SysML_ARM/SYSML_ARM_AP242.xmi#_2_attr_SYSML_ARM-Identification_assignment-items"/>
        <body>Entities like Description_text_assignment, Classification_assignment, Identification_assignment, etc. have their items property unmapped in the mapping specification since they have to be completed where used.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>Identifier</name>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1594974158696_973578_99916" xmi:uuid="766428c3-2b76-4cd2-9164-0e66cde664b0" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1599724998095_541275_89446" xmi:uuid="67019df2-9042-4710-a83b-a2178cc2f823" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_271a0567_1594974158696_973578_99916"/>
          <body>An instance of the entity Identifier used in the role Id or VersionId of any other entity shall be unique along id, role and context over all instances of the entity (for example over all instances of Part, all instances of Document, …). To be applied successfully on VersionId being unique only in combination with Id, the context of the VersionId shall refer to one of the Ids (for example given an instance #1 of Part.Id: PartVersion.id.identificationContext shall refer to #1). </body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>IP1</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193118_306906_23606"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1594974158697_656988_99917" xmi:uuid="abc641b3-ca0e-4a96-8513-3e56f440c58f" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>An instance of the entity Identifier used in the role Id or VersionId of any other entity shall be unique along id, role and context over all instances of the entity (for example over all instances of Part, all instances of Document, …). To be applied successfully on VersionId being unique only in combination with Id, the context of the VersionId shall refer to one of the Ids (for example given an instance #1 of Part.Id: PartVersion.id.identificationContext shall refer to #1). </body>
          <language>English</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
