        <body>A BoundingBox is a type of ShapeDependentProperty that is the bounding box of the shape, or of a portion of the shape of an object. &lt;br/&gt; The bounding box is a mean of providing information about a part extent and location. &lt;br/&gt; The bounding box is a characteristic of a part, not its shape. &lt;br/&gt; The box is aligned with the 3 axis of the GeometricCoordinateSpace associated to the property. &lt;br/&gt; As a consequence, each coordinate (X,Y,Z) of the 8 points of the box can have only two values: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;X coordinate can be either Xmin or Xmax.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Y coordinate can be either Ymin or Ymax.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Z coordinate can be either Zmin or Zmax.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; The bounding box is defined by the two opposite corner points: (Xmin, Ymin, Zmin) and (Xmax, Ymax, Zmax) &lt;note&gt;If a shape representation is present, the BoundingBox is usually derivable from the shape representation. However, as a characteristic of a part, it may be predefined in order to reflect a requirement.&lt;/note&gt; </body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>BoundingBox</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1663608413603_309605_163293" xmi:uuid="92c03d60-0913-4bcc-b92b-c39de47a722d" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193242_683026_23838"/>
      </generalization>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1663608854693_763184_163309" xmi:uuid="2abaa120-4b29-4245-8a1c-f001f0979ff2" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1663608854696_83998_163311" xmi:uuid="018a9513-2684-4b00-b1fc-8b7a3cf0e414" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1663608854693_763184_163309"/>
          <body> the GeometricCoordinateSpace in which the property is applicable. &lt;note&gt;The values of geometry related properties are specified relative to a GeometricCoordinateSpace.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>DefinedIn</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../RepresentationAndExternalElementReference/RepresentationAndExternalElementReference.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193112_722991_23591"/>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1663608870075_801114_163317"/>
        <redefinedProperty xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194052_749179_28893"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1663608900508_673536_163349" xmi:uuid="6bd59ccf-1b59-4d31-804c-11084b28ca68" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1663608900509_761944_163351" xmi:uuid="47af942a-0878-4f23-8ad2-517baa5981f2" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1663608900508_673536_163349"/>
          <body> a point in three-dimensional space that defines the location of the corner point (Xmin, Ymin, Zmin) in the GeometricCoordinateSpace.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>PointMin</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../RepresentationAndExternalElementReference/RepresentationAndExternalElementReference.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193035_360707_23436"/>
