        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455703733461_13435_42569" xmi:uuid="7d5529ec-8bb6-43b1-afd1-a0311bb32c92" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194052_916762_28894"/>
          <body> specifies information on how the ShapeDependentProperty shall be interpreted. Where applicable, the following values shall be used: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;'calculated': The value has been calculated; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'designed': The value represents a value intended by the design; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'estimated': The value has been estimated; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'measured': The value has been measured; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'required': The value represents a requirement.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; The value of this attribute need not be specified. </body>
        </ownedComment>
