          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193983_622384_28594"/>
          <body> information on how the PropertyValue shall be interpreted. Where applicable, the following values shall be used: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;'calculated': The value has been calculated; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'designed': The value represents a value intended by the design; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'estimated': The value has been estimated; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'measured': The value has been measured; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'required': The value represents a requirement; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'set point': The value is used as the initialization value.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
        </ownedComment>
