          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1513088556840_583644_52325"/>
          <body>the other object of State that is part of the relationship. &lt;note&gt; The semantics of this attribute are defined by the attribute RelationType.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
