    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193307_913859_23952" xmi:uuid="bc20301a-0c34-4242-82b3-73cadfb2ef72" xmi:type="uml:PrimitiveType">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1513259435927_325226_57677" xmi:uuid="e5f88983-0322-44c2-b9ee-ef19418b1887" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193307_913859_23952"/>
        <body>The PropertyDefinitionString is a string to specify the kind of a property.&lt;note&gt;The PropertyDefinitionString corresponds in the more detailed property concept to the attribute propertyType of PropertyDefinition.&lt;/note&gt; &lt;example&gt;’noise absorption’, ’power consumption’ or 'colour' are examples for the PropertyDefinitionString.&lt;/example&gt; </body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>PropertyDefinitionString</name>
