        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193256_436933_23860"/>
        <body>A StandardUncertainty is a type of UncertaintyQualifier. A StandardUncertainty may be an ExpandedUncertainty. The uncertainty is defined in clause 2 of "The Guide to the Expression of Uncertainty in Measurement".</body>
