          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193490_200331_25423"/>
          <body> the identifier or set of identifiers for the ClassificationRelationship. The value of this attribute need not be specified. &lt;note&gt; This attribute supports multi-identification in different contexts as described in Fundamental concepts and assumptions.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
