        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193123_772043_23610"/>
        <body>A model artefact that allows a generic data type to be used as a class object for a select. The IdentifierStringProxy allows to represent an identifier as a string. &lt;note&gt;As it is a modelling artefact, it may not be represented in the implementation form if the implementation languages have more efficient representation of the type in the select.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
