            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_290014c_1504705150257_522882_32290"/>
            <body>the id output is set to null if input is null, otherwise if input is of type Identifier it is set to input.idAsgn, otherwise it is set to null. </body>
          </ownedComment>
