        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193241_512299_23836"/>
        <body>A SetMembership is a relationship that is between a set and a thing that indicates the thing is a member of the set.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1550054675536_421057_118838" xmi:uuid="fee59bed-7959-47cc-81b1-52b60e6184fa" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement href="../../../../SysML_ARM/SYSML_ARM_AP242.xmi#_2_attr_SYSML_ARM-Classification_assignment-items"/>
        <body>Entities like Description_text_assignment, Classification_assignment, Identification_assignment, etc. have their items property unmapped in the mapping specification since they have to be completed where used.</body>
      </ownedComment>
