        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1513076037038_177241_42163"/>
        <body>A StateComposition is a type of StateRelationship that relates the nature of states in relation to one another, where two or more State parts compose a whole State. Whole states can also become parts of another whole State.</body>
