        <body> A PropertyValueAssignmentRelationship is a relation between PropertyValueAssignment objects.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>PropertyValueAssignmentRelationship</name>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1459331857065_671749_42709" xmi:uuid="f53dee7e-a342-48f0-bcd4-fe6032c1d21e" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1671209121476_539590_163092" xmi:uuid="65ab1233-c2cd-43e3-ab43-5bc92be873a6" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1671209121476_153002_163093" xmi:uuid="05c28bbb-f2f0-409e-bb7e-512d94ab2573" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body> &lt;sch:rule context="//PropertyValueAssignmentRelationship[@uid]"&gt;&#13; &lt;sch:let name="entity_name" value="if(@xsi:type) then substring-after(@xsi:type,':') else name()"/&gt;&#13; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt;&#13; &lt;sch:let name="uidRelating" value="../@uid"/&gt;&#13; &lt;sch:let name="uidRelated" value="Related/@uidRef"/&gt;&#13; &lt;sch:assert test="not(../@uid = Related/@uidRef)"&gt;&#13; The related PropertyValueAssignment and the relating PropertyValueAssignment shall be different. &#13; {&#13; -entity_name:&lt;sch:value-of select="$entity_name"/&gt;&#13; -entity_uid:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt; &#13; -rule_name:PropertyValueAssignmentRelationship.WR1&#13; -relating:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uidRelating"/&gt;&#13; -related:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uidRelated"/&gt;&#13; }&#13; &lt;/sch:assert&gt;&#13; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1459331895122_205686_42711" xmi:uuid="69a1a1ec-b4e2-4428-a0ef-3ee6e3ad5249" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1459331857065_671749_42709"/>
          <body>the related PropertyValueAssignment and the relating PropertyValueAssignment shall be different.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1671209121476_326546_163094" xmi:uuid="af375b3f-5309-4fde-a28a-fcb2f9ab027c" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1671209121476_476726_163095" xmi:uuid="7b7d7c42-f8ce-4917-8deb-d98b0c5d4471" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>WR1: Relating :&lt;&gt;: Related;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>EXPRESS</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>WR1</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193212_788120_23792"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1509116458868_763105_31510" xmi:uuid="1f865cf0-1731-4dc1-bf15-f602345812e0" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
